---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: stdout(&output)
---
Packs a directory into a versioned release

Usage: leptoskit codepush release [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --from <FROM>        The directory to release; defaults to `dist/` [default: dist]
      --store <STORE>      The release store directory; defaults to `releases/` [default: releases]
      --channel <CHANNEL>  The release channel [default: production]
      --mandatory          Whether the release is mandatory for clients
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
